        "id": 2717076,
        "name": "Annie Magnate",
        "username": "Annie_Magnate",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/annie_magnate/{size}/460497_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-05-14T20:54:54.675Z",
        "cooked": "<p>One of the critically missing feature is to display in each item details window where it can be acquired from.<br>\nThis could be really simple and valuable feature to implement, and for new players so crucial.</p>\n<p>I am not new to eve, but I am far from a veteran player. Anytime I see some new things I wonder how do I get those besides buying.  I know I can ask chatgpt nowadays, but it would be nice to have it in game.</p>",
